Third-party components
----------------------

CERNLIB routines (wclbes.F, r1dp.F-r8dp.F, clogam64.F, cdigam64.F,
gen/*): CERN Program Library, mathlib, 2006 release, Copyright CERN,
Geneva, distributed by CERN under the GNU General Public License.  The
files are unmodified.  WCLBES (C309) is COULCC by A. R. Barnett
(Manchester, 1981) and I. J. Thompson (Daresbury, 1983), form modified
by K. S. Koelbig (CERN, 1987), Comput. Phys. Commun. 36 (1985) 363;
its helper routines cite J. Patry and S. Gupta, EIR-Bericht 247 (1973),
and T. Takemasa, T. Tamura and H. H. Wolter, Comput. Phys. Commun. 17
(1979) 351.  c309prec.inc and mtlprt.for are local replacements for
CERNLIB's precision include and error printer.

GNU Scientific Library (GSL), GNU GPL version 3 or later: confluent
hypergeometric function U for the Whittaker function of closed
channels (intgsl.f90).  Linked, not included.

LAPACK and BLAS (modified BSD license), or Apple Accelerate on macOS:
complex matrix inversion.  Linked, not included.

The Clebsch-Gordan and Racah coefficients in rmbbb.f90 are
reimplementations of the CERNLIB DCLEBG and DRACAW algorithms.

